  "description": "Detached single storey annexe to rear for use ancillary to the main dwelling",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its location within an area at risk of flooding and the absence of an acceptable and comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment, has failed to demonstrate that the development would make appropriate provision for flood risk reduction and mitigation, and would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere. In particular, insufficient information has been provided regarding flood levels, depths, and appropriate mitigation measures. The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI12 and SI13 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies CN3 and CN4 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021–2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
